      "content": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n<table class=\"tg\" style=\"undefined;table-layout: fixed; width: 616px\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 46px\">\n<col style=\"width: 258px\">\n<col style=\"width: 48px\">\n<col style=\"width: 264px\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\">LIST I <br>Natural Amino Acid</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-7btt\">LIST II <br>One Letter Code</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">A.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Arginine</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">I.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">D</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">B.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Aspartic acid</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">II.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">N</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">C.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Asparagine</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">III.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">A</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">D.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">Alanine</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">R</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
